      "icon": null,
      "description": "One row per external repository referenced on a FedRAMP Certification Package Overview -- pairs with fedramp-certification-package.rain. Covers that schema's trustCenter, secureConfigurationGuidance, and additionalRepositories in one register instead of three different single-value fields, since they all share this same repository shape and additionalRepositories is explicitly open-ended. Each Asset's own \"Name\" field is a short label you choose for the repository (e.g. \"Public Trust Center\"), independent of repository type.",
